temps-nixpacks
==============

This crate is derived from nixpacks v1.41.0 by Railway Corp.
Upstream project: https://github.com/railwayapp/nixpacks
Upstream license: MIT (see LICENSE)

Temps maintains a trimmed library-only fork for Dockerfile and build-plan
generation. The CLI binary and unused docker-daemon / incremental-cache
file-server paths are not included.
